        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "TLS has been a customer and vendor for many years, and they have been great to work with.  I highly recommend them to all of my friends and family who need help with any type of logistics to/from Canada and Worldwide.  Their response time is fast and overall very efficient.  Thank you for being awesome TLS!",
        "time": 1740606980,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jessica McGrath",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116342694485060472053/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVgljQNqk1Pvt4tJ9qnPEth-J_m1qx3ikp3bTwlujvO8OfDf4E7Ag=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "We have been working with TLS for several years now for all our transport needs. Simon is always available to provide great service and meet our strict/ last minute deadlines. The response rate is  truly impressive and hard to find in todays market. Despite what you may think about working with brokers, the prices are always fair and quite competitive. Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1665505623,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "paul singh",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102935442929831829807/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKslvlSoqvRHkP-2i6UsogrCJ1wK6k8bRX9Fw0dtE8MBWez0w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "One of the best companies to work with .We have partnered with TLS for over 6 years now .Management and the entire team especially Stuart McCullagh are always up front and honest about what they can do and how they can do it. We  Never had any issues with loads or payments. They always have been proactive in helping with all the solutions whenever we needed them.  I would not hesitate to recommend partnering with TLS for all your transportation needs.",
        "time": 1647627206,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kathy Doyle",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103919049140894943693/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWyx7OoohgUIPc9uYaB8qIcVGlZv7gNTYSyrKp3WNv94i73Tf4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "We have been using TLS for our inbound and outbound shipments in Canada and U.S. for well over 10 years now and have had nothing but excellent service from them.  With help from Ryan and his team including Simon and Bonnie, we have always had the best customer service you could hope for and shipments come and go on time as promised whether it be one pallet or a full truckload, they take care of it all!    Highly recommend them for your shipping needs as you’ll have one less thing to worry about once they have your shipment.",
        "time": 1646253681,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Raymond Bujold",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117355038347333617399/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXiaGa_8U3PrpE6bBSQZkMQhhHlLZibIGcv_yPReOW4Er3BggY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I have been using TLS since 2018 for my distribution company, the service as been time after time exceptional. Also often I have compare costing with other transportation company and TLS has always been the best or the same.\n\nI would recommended this company as they really do cater to small business or large.",
